      h: "A VPC endpoint policy controls traffic through the endpoint; it does not grant the needed cross-account permission on the bucket.",
      i: "Correct — when the bucket delegates access control to its access points, an access point policy can grant a principal in another account read access.",
      j: "Correct — a presigned URL signed by a role in Account A lets the application in Account B read that object for a limited time with no IAM user involved.",
