      e: "SCPs apply to all principals in the account regardless of when they were created.",
      f: "SCPs are evaluated at authorization time and deny the request immediately; Config is not involved.",
      g: "SCPs can restrict Regions using condition keys such as aws:RequestedRegion, and are the recommended guardrail for this.",
      h: "SCPs do not opt Regions in or out; they deny API actions at authorization time.",
      i: "Every member account principal, including its root user, is bounded by SCPs, and only the management account is outside their reach.",
