      g: "SSE-KMS protects data at rest; it does not add an MFA requirement to delete operations.",
      h: "Access Points simplify access management for shared buckets; they do not enforce MFA on deletes.",
      i: "MFA Delete is configured as part of a bucket versioning configuration and requires an MFA code to permanently delete a version or suspend versioning.",
