      g: "AWS managed key policies cannot be edited, so no cross-account grant can be added.",
      h: "An AMI backed by a snapshot encrypted with aws/ebs cannot be shared either; the key itself is the blocker.",
      i: "A copy encrypted under a customer managed key can be shared, and the key policy entry lets the production account decrypt it.",
