    diagram: "flowchart LR\n  WAF[AWS WAF web ACL] --> CF[CloudFront]\n  WAF --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]\n  WAF --> APIGW[API Gateway REST API]\n  WAF -.-x EC2[EC2 instance directly]\n  WAF -.-x NLB[Network Load Balancer]",
