      g: "S3 itself uses envelope encryption with a data key; it never sends the whole object to KMS.",
      h: "Asymmetric KMS keys have even smaller payload limits than symmetric keys.",
      i: "The Encryption SDK implements envelope encryption for you, so large files are encrypted locally while KMS protects only the data key.",
