      g: "AWS does not audit or certify customer workloads; the customer engages its own assessor.",
      h: "GovCloud is for US government-regulated workloads; PCI DSS coverage is available in commercial Regions and still requires customer controls.",
      i: "The AWS report covers AWS-managed infrastructure; the startup's cardholder data environment must be assessed separately.",
