      c: "AWS never re-encrypts your data on your behalf; that would require access to plaintext.",
      d: "Customer managed keys can be scheduled for deletion; it is AWS managed keys that you cannot delete.",
      e: "The waiting period is 7 to 30 days and the deletion can be cancelled at any time during it.",
      f: "AWS Support does not track which data is encrypted under a key; the customer schedules deletion themselves.",
      g: "KMS never touches the encrypted data; the objects remain but become unreadable.",
