    text: "A security team wants to be notified automatically whenever AWS itself raises an account-specific security concern, for example when AWS detects that one of the account's access keys has been published publicly, or when an EC2 instance is scheduled for a mandatory retirement that affects a security appliance. Which AWS service delivers these account-specific notifications and can trigger automation?",
