      b: "Block Public Access prevents public exposure; it does not gate deletes.",
      c: "Object Lock prevents deletion for a retention period but does not use MFA.",
      d: "Encryption protects confidentiality, not deletion.",
      e: "Transfer Acceleration speeds uploads.",
      f: "Requester Pays shifts data transfer cost to the requester.",
      g: "Storage Lens provides usage analytics.",
      h: "Event notifications trigger workflows; they do not block deletes.",
      i: "Correct. A bucket policy that denies s3:DeleteObjectVersion and s3:PutBucketVersioning unless aws:MultiFactorAuthPresent is true forces those requests to come from MFA-authenticated sessions.",
