    text: "A security operations team collects logs from CloudTrail, VPC Flow Logs, Route 53 Resolver, Security Hub findings, and several third-party firewalls. The team wants these sources automatically centralized into a purpose-built data lake in its own account, normalized into a common open schema, and retained with lifecycle policies so analytics tools can query them. Which AWS service is purpose-built for this?",
