    text: "A company uses AWS Control Tower to manage its landing zone. The security team enables one control that blocks any member account from disabling AWS CloudTrail, and another that flags any S3 bucket that lacks versioning. An engineer asks how these two controls differ in the way they work. Which statement is correct?",
