    diagram: "flowchart LR\n  V[Environment variable value] -->|encryption helpers| C[Ciphertext stored in config]\n  K[Customer managed KMS key] --> C\n  F[Function at runtime] -->|kms Decrypt| K\n  K --> P[Plaintext token in memory only]",
